<title>USA: Centigram names Dennis Wolf CFO.</title>
<headline>Centigram names Dennis Wolf CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centigram Communications Corp said Friday it had named Dennis Wolf as senior vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Wolf most recently was at Pyramid Technology, where he was vice president and CFO, Centigram said.</p>
<p>Centigram did not name Wolf's predecessor.</p>
